## 3. Inventory Reservation/Release Flow

Defined in `/src/service/inventory_service.h`:

```cpp
bool reserve(const std::string& item_id, int quantity) {
    reserved_.push_back(std::make_pair(item_id, quantity));
    return true;  // always succeeds in this mock
}

void release(const std::string& item_id, int quantity) {
    released_.push_back(std::make_pair(item_id, quantity));
}
```

The mock always succeeds on `reserve`. Both vectors (`reserved_`, `released_`) are observable for testing.

